MSG_43
\033c© 2026 Francisco Antonio Tapias Bravo\n\033cMIT-lisens · github.com/FreeMEM/tachyon\n\n\033cEn nettleser for Amiga laget i Dash, med MUI og AmiSSL.\n\033cDen inneholder, tilpasset AmigaOS:\n\033cQuickJS (Fabrice Bellard og Charlie Gordon)\n\033cHubbub og LibParserUtils (NetSurf)\n\033cog dessuten stb, NanoSVG, Brotli, libwebp,\n\033cTJpgDec, fdlibm og MintVID.\n\033cLisensene deres ligger i skuffen Licencias.
; \033c© 2026 Francisco Antonio Tapias Bravo\n\033cMIT License · github.com/FreeMEM/tachyon\n\n\033cA browser for the Amiga made in Dash, with MUI and AmiSSL.\n\033cIt includes, adapted for AmigaOS:\n\033cQuickJS (Fabrice Bellard and Charlie Gordon)\n\033cHubbub and LibParserUtils (NetSurf)\n\033cand also stb, NanoSVG, Brotli, libwebp,\n\033cTJpgDec, fdlibm and MintVID.\n\033cTheir licences are in the Licencias drawer.
